  "title": "Macaroni and Cheese III",
  "description": "The lively flavors of sharp Cheddar cheese, tangy yogurt, and stewed tomatoes dress up the sauce for this comforting stovetop macaroni and cheese. A bit of celery seed and dried basil are tasty additions.",
